# M3.5.2 Core workflow discovery diagnostic — 2026-08-27

## Failure

Two local, read-only discovery commands used nonexistent literal paths:
`.github/workflows/ci.yml` and a separate `workflows` argument. The actual
workflow is `.github/workflows/core-ci.yml`.

## Impact and correction

Neither command wrote to the Core or Control repository. Core remained clean at
its exact `main` baseline. Subsequent checks must address the discovered path
directly and must not pass speculative path arguments.
